-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Island\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Region</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Ferwater</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Shop\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Shop</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">The Skull Rock</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Price\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Price</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">$3,000 (In small bombs)<p>$1,200 (In Large bomb)</p></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Function\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Function</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Emberbane axe quest</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content\">\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Version Added\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">v1.25.0, v1.46.0 for burnt</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Date Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">?</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><br />\nThe <b>Skull</b> is a quest object. It can be obtained from the top of <a href=\"/wiki/Skull_Rock\" title=\"Skull Rock\">Skull Rock</a> by destroying the hatch using explosives (3 <a href=\"/wiki/Small_Bomb\" title=\"Small Bomb\">small bombs</a>).\n</p><p>You can also obtain it at the acidlands by killing some skeletons, with a still not confirmed drop rate.\n</p><p>it sells for 250$ being burnt or not, at the resource hub.\n</p><p>It also could be obtained from the <b>2024 Halloween event</b> from the blood moon event.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Details\">Details</span></h2>\n<p>The Skull, in its initial state, is simply a decorative object. However, if taken down to the <a href=\"/wiki/Magma_Caves\" title=\"Magma Caves\">Magma Caves</a> and left near a heat source, the Skull will begin to burn. As it burns, it turns a deeper, darker shade of red, until it has completely burnt. At this point, the skull will emit a black flame particle and be renamed the <b>Burning Skull</b>. This can take a variable amount of time, usually about 5-10 minutes, which can greatly increase if the server is lagging. The Burning Skull is used to acquire the <a href=\"/wiki/Emberbane\" title=\"Emberbane\">Emberbane</a>; should a player wish to acquire the Burning Skull, it is best to check the object to see if it is making progress, or if the name has changed.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gallery\">Gallery</span></h2>\n<div id=\"gallery-1\" hash=\"93ed6ea7e2887f85b06c5f7937437e4b\" data-seq-no=\"1\" class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-left wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-left wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:185px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"Festive_skull-png\" style=\"position: relative; height:183px; width:185px;\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/wiki/File:Festive_skull.png\" title=\"Festive skull.png (61 KB)\" style=\"height:183px; width:185px;\"><noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/a/ab/Festive_skull.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/185?cb=20240112140401\" title=\"Festive skull.png (61 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"The Skull during December 2023.\" height=\"183\" width=\"185\" data-image-name=\"Festive skull.png\" data-image-key=\"Festive_skull.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-caption=\"The Skull during December 2023.\"></noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" title=\"Festive skull.png (61 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"The Skull during December 2023.\" height=\"183\" width=\"185\" data-image-name=\"Festive skull.png\" data-image-key=\"Festive_skull.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-caption=\"The Skull during December 2023.\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/a/ab/Festive_skull.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/185?cb=20240112140401\" /></a></div></div><div class=\"lightbox-caption\" style=\"width:185px;\">The Skull during December 2023.</div></div></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260902103956\nCache expiry: 1209600\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.034 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.042 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 75/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 43/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 26/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 5/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 1737/5000000 bytes\nLua time usage: 0.006/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1019494/104857600 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   31.823      1 Template:Objects\n100.00%   31.823      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.9_prod_oaklands:pcache:idhash:1029-0!sseVary=RegularPage!FandomDesktop!LegacyGalleries and timestamp 20260902103956 and revision id 17168. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>","categories":["Items","Quest_Items"],"links":[{"title":"Emberbane","exists":true},{"title":"Magma Caves","exists":true},{"title":"Skull Rock","exists":true},{"title":"Small Bomb","